{"additions":397,"assignees":[],"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"## Summary\n\nThe Files view's `o` (open with the OS default application) and `O` (open with an application named in a prompt, remembered for next time) are now available in the Git view's file tree and in the PR diff window. The diff window's browser key moves from `o` to `b`, so `o` means the same thing in every view.\n\nCloses #204\n\n![github demo](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/td72/vig/feat/open-in-tree/assets/demo-github-pr.gif)\n\n## Changes\n\n- **core**: `OpenWithPrompt` and `open_path_message` move to `core::ui::open_with`; the Files view uses them (behaviour unchanged)\n- **git**: `\"o\" \"OpenDefault\"` / `\"O\" \"OpenWith\"` in the `view` keys. A file the working tree no longer has (a deletion) is reported in the status bar\n- **diff window**: the same `o` / `O`; the file is looked up in the PR's worktree first, then in the working tree (shared with `e`). `OpenBrowser` (the PR's Files tab) moves to `b`\n- **docs**: README / README.ja, the guide's Git and GitHub chapters, the Config Reference (en / ja) tables for page `git` and window `diff`\n- **demo**: the PR tape presses `O` (the demo repository has no such file, so the status line points to `W`)\n\n## Tests\n\n- The prompt tests move to core. Git view: `O` opens the prompt when the selected file exists (every key goes to it, Esc cancels), `o` reports a missing file. Diff window: the same, plus the `b` / `o` help labels. Loader: the `o` / `O` / `b` bindings of page `git` and window `diff`\n- `cargo test`: 438 passed; clippy / fmt / pre-commit pass; GIF re-recorded\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01N7wFSHbpTzvkK6WS1CRS7b","changedFiles":18,"comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-10-23T10:42:42Z","deletions":157,"headRefName":"feat/open-in-tree","labels":[],"number":205,"reviewDecision":"","reviewRequests":[],"reviews":[{"id":"PRR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABT2fxvA","author":{"login":"copilot-pull-request-reviewer"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"<!-- ccr-overview-v2 -->\n\n### 🟡 Changes recommended\n\nThe Git Log shortcut is shadowed, and refreshes can redirect an active application prompt to a different file.\n\n<details open>\n<summary><strong>2 open issues</strong></summary>\n\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Allow OpenDefault to dispatch o to the focused Git Log pane](https://github.com/td72/vig/pull/205#discussion_r4358705059) · New\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Retain the original O prompt target through confirmation](https://github.com/td72/vig/pull/205#discussion_r4358705102) · New\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>What changed in this PR</strong></summary>\n\nExtends the Files view’s `o` / `O` file-opening actions to the Git view and PR diff window, using a shared application prompt.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Adds default-app and named-app opening, with status messages for missing files.\n- Moves the diff window’s browser shortcut to `b`.\n- Updates keybinding tests, bilingual documentation, and the PR demo.\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| `tape/​demo-github-pr.tape` | Demonstrates `O` for a missing PR file. |\r\n| `src/​git/​state.rs` | Adds file-opening actions, prompt handling, and tests. |\r\n| `src/​files/​state.rs` | Reuses the shared prompt and opening helper. |\r\n| `src/​diff_window/​state.rs` | Adds opening actions using worktree-aware path lookup. |\r\n| `src/​core/​ui/​status_bar.rs` | Displays application prompts in both views. |\r\n| `src/​core/​ui/​open_with.rs` | Extracts the shared prompt, helper, and tests. |\r\n| `src/​core/​ui/​mod.rs` | Exports the shared module. |\r\n| `src/​core/​config/​loader.rs` | Tests the updated default keybindings. |\r\n| `README.md` | Updates opening and diff-window shortcut documentation. |\r\n| `docs/​README.ja.md` | Updates Japanese shortcut documentation. |\r\n| `docs/​guide/​src/​views-github.md` | Documents diff-window opening actions. |\r\n| `docs/​guide/​src/​views-git.md` | Documents Git file-opening behavior. |\r\n| `docs/​guide/​src/​config-reference.md` | Lists the new actions and browser shortcut. |\r\n| `docs/​guide/​ja/​src/​views-github.md` | Updates the Japanese diff-window guide. |\r\n| `docs/​guide/​ja/​src/​views-git.md` | Updates the Japanese Git guide. |\r\n| `docs/​guide/​ja/​src/​config-reference.md` | Updates Japanese action and key tables. |\r\n| `assets/​demo-github-pr.gif` | Updates the recorded PR demo. |\r\n| `assets/​default.kdl` | Adds `o` / `O` and remaps diff browsing to `b`. |\n</details>\n\n<sub>Review effort: Balanced</sub>","submittedAt":"2026-10-23T10:46:54Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"COMMENTED","commit":{"oid":"03f15d0bdb9430de1c002657c9404e451df3095e"}}],"state":"MERGED","statusCheckRollup":[{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-23T10:48:23Z","conclusion":"SKIPPED","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/39941675151/job/120374352621","name":"crea